OL,3,APresidential villa suffers water and
OL,4,Apower cuts, Nigerian leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's President Bola Tinubu says
OL,7,Fthe presidential villa suffers from
OL,8,Fcuts in electricity and water - issues
OL,9,Fthat are all too common for the
OL,10,Fcountry's ordinary citizens.
OL,12,FHe said he was shaving last week when
OL,13,Fthe water supply cut at the villa,
OL,14,Fknown as Aso Rock, in Abuja.
OL,16,FHe is seeking re-election next January
OL,17,Fand vowed to address these issues.
OL,19,FTinubu made the disclosure on Sunday at
OL,20,Fa special prayer session organised in
OL,21,Fhis honour by members of his family in
OL,22,FLagos.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
